# write-same: pattern repeated; error cases
writesame 0 12 "ab"
---
read 0 20; stat
---
writesame 3 4 "xy"
---
read 0 20
---
# length not a multiple of the pattern -> EINVAL
writesame 0 5 "ab"
---
# empty pattern -> EINVAL
writesame 0 4 ""
---
# length 0 -> success, nothing happens
writesame 0 0 "ab"
---
read 0 20
---
# on a missing object, length 0 must not create it
delete
---
writesame 0 0 "ab"
---
stat
